  itemSpr: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e43449c078ef95748a8ff3766ef4e00b, type: 3}
  itemDesc: "Strike with the soul when it is exposed. Make a swift slashing attack,
    but only while wounded.\r\n\r\nThe spellblades and mage-scholars of Vita embraced
    the integration of the magical and the martial, but hesitated in the face of
    magic first developed by warriors. Though never strictly forbidden, the use of
    one\u2019s raw and exposed life essence was considered extremist."
